WEBVTT

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:23.910
Miyu?

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.530
Miyu...

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.560
Where am I?

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:12.850
<b>Episode 1 
City Fading to Silver</b>

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.810
Thank you for today.

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:17.090
Sorry for imposing so suddenly.

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:19.950
Exploring your mansion was really fun!

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.620
No, she only helped us with our homework.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:26.330
But thanks to you, I think we 
can manage on our own now.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.920
Thanks, Miyu.

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:30.330
It was nothing...

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.460
What is it, Illya?

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:37.520
I'm happy that you're all getting along well!

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:40.630
I can see why tsunderes are popular...

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.640
What are you talking about?

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.610
Nothing!

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:52.560
Huh? Are you going somewhere too, Miyu?

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:54.890
Yeah. Illya's room.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.530
To do what?

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.700
What? To fuse with Sapphire and Ruby again—

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:00.280
Idiot!

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:01.530
Ruby?

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.420
Sapphire?

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:03.280
Fusing?

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:09.870
Uh, that's not it! We, um, uh...

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:12.580
Why are you so flustered?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.240
Is it some game?

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:17.340
By "fusing," do you mean robots? Show me, too!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:20.590
No, it's not something we can show others!

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.630
You can't show others?

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:27.260
That's kinda suspicious...

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:29.730
Is it life-sized? Can you pilot it?!

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.970
Uh, uh...

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:31.530
Illya!

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:34.270
Does it fire beams, too?

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:34.270
Hey, Illya, I said!

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:35.190
Illya...

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.860
No, you two.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:41.570
It's too soon for us to learn about such things.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.050
That's not it!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:47.540
It's not what you're thinking, Mimi!

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:48.870
It's not?

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.370
Then what is it?

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.920
Spill it already.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.670
It's a robot, right? Tell me it's a robot!

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:57.680
A-Actually...

00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:59.600
Actually?

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:01.470
Actually,

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.720
it is what Mimi was saying.

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:09.060
Idiot.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:10.610
Illya...

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:16.460
Mimi, what's too soon for us to learn?

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:19.110
Huh? Th-Th-That's...

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.110
What did you do, Illya?

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.690
What <i>could</i> I do?

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:29.020
We're home!

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.200
Pardon me.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.130
Welcome home.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.580
Onii-chan!

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.140
Welcome home.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:38.090
Hey.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:42.370
Today, we did our homework 
at Luvia-san's place.

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:43.140
Oh?

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:44.090
Good afternoon.

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.210
I hear Illya and Kuro were at your place?

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:48.850
Thanks for having them.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:53.540
N-No, it was nothing. They're friends.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.230
I see.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:59.230
Since you're here, why not 
join us for dinner later?

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.270
Yeah.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.740
Then we can thank you for them, too.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.780
No, that's...

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.660
Come on, come on.

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:08.910
Eat with us!

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.780
It's nothing to hold back over.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:15.060
Uh, then, thank you for the invitation.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.980
A breath of relief...

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:23.740
What is it, Illya-san?

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:26.220
You aren't talking like a young woman.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.040
Ah, Ruby!

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.810
Are you tired?

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:32.000
You must be tired, right?

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.210
Very well.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:38.400
Then let's give you one of Ruby-chan's 
approved special shots!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:39.810
Absolutely not!

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.680
You'll be fine.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:44.320
Once I inject this, your weariness, reason,

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.580
and mind will all blow right away!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:48.030
I guarantee it.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:51.660
But two of those should never be blown away!

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:58.500
Now, use this, and enter a salacious 
world that dazzles the senses...

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:01.540
Go on, go on, go on!

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:01.010
Wai—

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:06.010
Nee-san, please control yourself.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:07.760
Sapphire...

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:12.220
Well, I was bored!

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:15.220
Illya-san's group was doing homework,

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:20.440
and Rin-san's group has been run ragged 
with reports to the Association...

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:26.190
That doesn't count as a good reason to inject 
Illya-sama with a suspicious drug.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:30.320
Wrong! I need her to take 
better care of her health!

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:34.520
Illya-san's my precious to— master, after all.

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:36.830
You almost said "toy" just now, didn't you?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.260
No, that's not true at all.

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:41.650
Nee-san, you should learn when to quit.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.090
What?

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.430
What is it?

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:54.220
Well, I was just thinking these 
peaceful days are nice.

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:56.150
Peaceful?

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.690
They're rather lively, though.

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.520
Well, not that way.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:05.820
I mean these normal, "nothing happening" days.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.280
I know.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:11.680
Yeah.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:14.450
Honestly,

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:18.020
I wish these times would last forever.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.510
It's an emergency!

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.370
These times...

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:26.560
Forever?

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:30.380
No, never mind.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.050
Something's odd with the mountain?

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.870
That's nothing new.

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.670
After all that happened there,

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:40.270
isn't it natural the mountain would be a wreck?

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:43.150
It would be nice if that were all.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:46.070
The Church's observer is there, too.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:48.150
So covering it up wouldn't be impossible.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:51.650
Then is there something else off about it?

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:56.030
No... In fact, it's like nothing is wrong with it.

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:57.530
Huh?

00:07:58.220 --> 00:07:59.550
What do you mean?

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:01.400
If nothing's wrong, that's a good thing.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:03.240
I don't mean like that.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.900
They're gone.

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:09.130
The crater formed by your battle

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:12.270
and all the other irregularities are totally gone.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:17.550
Doesn't that mean the Church did 
something to take care of them?

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:18.980
That's impossible.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:21.710
Even if they'd managed to act this fast,

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:24.380
concealing it so no one would 
notice would be their best effort.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:27.470
They could never repair it.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:31.300
That's why I called it an emergency.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.570
That reminds me,

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.930
we never did find the eighth Card, did we?

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:42.160
No.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:56.220
Hey, hey, what's the meaning of this?

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.420
The Cards that went to the other side are here?

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.310
We might be able to reclaim them.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:09.670
Great, great! I'm getting excited!

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.870
You all came, too?

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:25.800
Bazett...

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.580
Have you learned anything?

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:32.240
Nothing detailed at the moment.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.300
What's this?

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:42.680
Everyone, be careful.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.440
Huh?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.920
What does all of this mean?

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:56.280
It's like

00:09:56.710 --> 00:10:00.030
the dimension is unstable, 
swaying back and forth.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:13.510
Huh? Someone's there?

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:24.470
Run!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:25.350
Huh?

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.110
Miyu!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:56.710
Fire!

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.050
What are you doing?

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.660
Wow, you're pretty good.

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:21.830
I'll give you a reward, then!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.410
Wh-What's happening?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:29.910
Who...

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.500
are they?

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:39.800
And I thought we'd finally found them.

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:42.430
Forget them.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.680
We'll only recover the 
priority target right now.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.810
We have come to retrieve you, Miyu-sama.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.820
N-No...

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.830
I don't want to go back.

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:02.730
So you've started to speak that way?

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:07.100
Huh?

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:15.920
Jeez, don't waste our time.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:21.010
Treat her carefully. If the 
contents were to spill...

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.590
Why, you...

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:30.060
Get away from Miyu!

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:33.040
You are?

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:38.290
Oh? I don't get it, but if you're 
trying to get in our way,

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.320
you're ready for the consequences, right?

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:50.060
So much mana...

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:53.610
Blast away!

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.500
Stop. That's enough.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:57.920
Huh?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:09.260
It's coming.

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:10.870
We're swaying back.

00:13:14.530 --> 00:13:15.630
The sky?

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:19.290
What's this? The world is splitting?

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:21.060
What?

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.680
I can't see any—

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.330
Illya...

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:31.240
Illya...

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:34.250
Miyu!

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:37.340
Illya, help me...

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.790
Miyu!

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:14.240
Miyu?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.040
Miyu...

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:45.170
Kuro! Rin-san! Luvia-san!

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.200
Where is everyone?

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:03.040
Well, I can't do anything by myself.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:05.470
I need to rejoin everyone!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:10.760
Ruby! Sapphire! Bazett-san!

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:14.530
What do I do? No one's here.

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:18.960
Given the situation,

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.900
maybe they went home for the time being.

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:25.770
I'll try going home, too.

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:31.000
It's cold.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.810
It's cold...

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:35.630
Why is it snowing in the middle of summer?

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:39.000
What in the world is going on?

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.350
Once I pass through here, the city is...

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.980
What... is this?

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.530
Faster! I have to hurry home!

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:17.780
I'm sure Mama must be worried about me.

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:22.500
Sella, too... And Liz, and Onii-chan!

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:37.420
I'm going back...

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.170
home!

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:08.310
<i>I knew it...</i>

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:11.150
<i>It's snowing.</i>

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:12.980
<i>There's a crater.</i>

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:15.690
<i>The city's in ruins.</i>

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:17.970
<i>There are no signs of people here.</i>

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:19.940
<i>This is</i>

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:22.430
<i>an unfamiliar world.</i>

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.050
Why?

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.250
What's happening here?

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:32.190
What do I do?

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:35.290
I don't know anything about this...

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:42.620
Ruby... Rin-san... Luvia-san... Kuro...

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:45.970
Where did you go?

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.170
Miyu!

00:17:58.570 --> 00:17:59.180
Huh?

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:11.820
O-Ow... Cold... And also heavy!

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:15.740
I hit my butt and head...

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:20.150
Jeez, your shouting made me trip.

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:21.910
Were you doing vocal training?

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:29.090
Whoa! You're an idiot, wearing such 
thin clothing when it's snowing.

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:30.330
Aren't you cold?

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.540
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:34.950
Why not?

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:36.860
You're only wearing gym clothes!

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:40.340
What are gym clothes?

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.720
What you're wearing right now!

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:43.870
Huh?

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:47.040
Ah, jeez...

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:49.900
But thank goodness.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:52.530
People are here.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.030
Um, Tanaka-san?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:03.170
"Ta-na-ka-san"?

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:07.960
You're Tanaka-san, right?

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:11.450
That's what the label on your chest says.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:15.340
Nakata!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:16.800
Tanaka!

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:26.520
That's good!

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:30.510
I'm surprised you can drink cold 
water right now, Tanaka-san.

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:33.170
You're shivering.

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:35.890
If you're that cold, why don't 
you wear more clothes?

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:39.320
I said I don't want to hear that from you!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:42.780
Aren't you cold in your outfit, Tanaka-san?

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:47.170
I'm toasty!

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:48.690
See?

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.960
Wow, you really are warm.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.150
<i>Her body temperature's</i>

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.970
<i>so high in this weather, 
when she's only in gym clothes?</i>

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:00.920
<i>She doesn't look like she has a fever.</i>

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:03.390
<i>Who in the world is she?</i>

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:04.380
<i>But...</i>

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:08.700
<i>Staying like this is warm and relaxing.</i>

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:19.190
Hey, Tanaka-san, I'd like to ask you some things.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:20.820
Go ahead.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:23.070
I'll answer anything.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.360
What's going on in this city?

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:27.330
How did it get so trashed?

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:28.830
I don't know.

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:31.320
What's that crater about?

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:33.500
What's with this snow? What's the date?

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:35.980
I don't know.

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:37.960
You don't know?

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:40.450
But you live here, don't you?

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:42.720
How could you not know?

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:48.850
Hmm, rather... Where are we right now?

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.780
Who am I?

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:55.460
<i>There's someone who's worse off than I am.</i>

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:33.040
How did it come to this?

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:36.720
If only I knew where Miyu was, at least...

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:41.130
Miyu's been captured by the Ainsworth family.

00:22:43.050 --> 00:22:46.720
I heard she jumped to a parallel world, 
but she's come back.

00:22:46.980 --> 00:22:48.520
Wh-What?

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:50.430
You know Miyu?

00:22:50.430 --> 00:22:52.580
And what do you mean by "parallel world"?

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:56.670
I... I don't know.

00:22:56.670 --> 00:22:58.630
That just came out.

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:01.270
What is this memory?

00:23:01.270 --> 00:23:05.190
Please remember it! It's extremely important!

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:08.390
"Ainsworth"...

00:23:08.810 --> 00:23:10.680
What is it about that name?

00:23:11.340 --> 00:23:13.690
I've almost got something...

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:17.530
Found you.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:35.970
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:25.340
Let's go for a round!

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:26.400
Are you in there?

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:28.420
If you are, answer me! Miyu!

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.930
That family has to be destroyed.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:32.590
That is my objective.

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:36.090
<b>Encounters and Reunions</b>

